Authored example: written for foss-mcp against the pinned library, not taken from the upstream README; published only after the ingestion verifier compiled or ran it against that commit.
Holds the eight-byte PNG signature in a byte array and passes it to ImageProbe.DetectFormat, which returns the matching ImageFormat without decoding any pixels.

Example:
// Authored example: detect an image format from its signature bytes
using System;
using Aspose.Imaging.Foss;

